<title>AUSTRALIA: Spotless Group year net rises 49 pct.</title>
<headline>Spotless Group year net rises 49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   32.18 vs 29.84</p>
<p>    Net				    18.05 vs 12.09</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    6.0  vs  5.5</p>
<p>Note: Spotless Group Ltd is a diversified services group with interests in catering, garments and plastics.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	   12.5  vs 9.5</p>
<p>    Sales				 692.11 vs 615.67</p>
<p>    Other income			 16.96  vs  1.95</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  17.6   vs 11.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	     profit 8.24  vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked.</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 2</p>
<p>Reg date Sept 18</p>
<p>    Tax				    15.13  vs 11.27</p>
<p>    Interest				4.00  vs  4.15</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 14.78  vs 13.50</p>
</text>
